# Edit Suggestions for 传递善意，点亮心灯 (Lesson 22)

Translator: AI
Reviewer: AI (self-review)
Date: 2026-08-06

## Summary

Course practice manual (MPI 个人传灯实践课, Lesson 22 of the Mindful Peace Academy 同喜班 curriculum). Register is instructional and warm, in the "we/our" voice of the organization addressing its members. Terminology follows the Mindful Peace Academy Student Handbook translation and the 禅意项目 table in the terms DB. Three source anomalies flagged below; none affect the translation.

